#X text 82 656 0: messages (see Messages below), f 64;
#X obj 60 700 cnv 10 10 10 empty empty Outlets 24 6 0 14 #1e3791 #000000 0;
#X text 82 724 0: signal (mono) \; 1: events: choke \, done \, value \, dump, f 64;
#X obj 60 784 cnv 10 10 10 empty empty Messages 24 6 0 14 #1e3791 #000000 0;
#X text 82 808 bang \, <1-127>: trigger \, the number is the velocity \; <control> <0-127>: set a control by name \, e.g. ptch 64 \; ctl <index> <0-127> \, params v0 v1 ...: set by index \; defaults \, reset: default controls \, restart the voice \; level <0-8>: output gain \, default 1 \; get <control>: reply 'value <control> <v>' on outlet 1 \; print: voice \, controls and sample rate to the Pd window \; choke \, chokems <ms>: fade the voice out \, default 3 ms \; store <0-15> \, recall <0-15>: 16 internal slots \; dump \, dump <0-15>: send all controls to outlet 1 \; dump trxcb v0 v1 ...: restore a dump of this voice, f 64;
#X obj 60 1012 cnv 10 10 10 empty empty Controls\ (index\ name\ default) 24 6 0 14 #1e3791 #000000 0;
#X text 82 1036 0 ptch (100): Controls the basic pitch. \; 1 dec (50): Controls the decay time. \; 2 enh (127): Enhances the body of the sound. \; 3 damp (127): Dampens the decay part. \; 4 tone (0): Changes tonal quality. \; 5 bump (0): Adds a pitchshift at the start of the sound., f 64;
#X obj 60 1160 cnv 10 10 10 empty empty Choke\ and\ presets 24 6 0 14 #1e3791 #000000 0;
#X text 82 1184 Outlet 1 sends 'choke' at every trigger. Connect it to the \; inlet of another voice to cut that voice off \, e.g. \; [trxch~] outlet 1 -> [trxoh~] inlet. \; 'dump' sends 'dump trxcb v0 v1 ...' to outlet 1 - keep it in \; [text define -k] and send it back to restore the controls., f 64;
#X text 82 1292 Credits: mdkit by soejrd (CC0) \; Pd wrapper skandrums-pd (CC0) \, built with Claude (Anthropic) \; Machine texts: Elektron Machinedrum manual \, Appendix A, f 64;
